+        /* In Retina mode the Win32 screen is expressed in backing pixels, so
+         * HORZRES/VERTRES have to be scaled up from the value the next driver
+         * reports.  That is only true while that value comes from the display
+         * itself: with a virtual desktop it is already in Win32 pixels, and
